# Core Guardrails

Non-negotiable standards that apply to all code in the repository.

## TypeScript only

All code must be written in TypeScript. No exceptions.

## Import conventions

Use relative paths within `frontend/src/`. Group imports logically (external libs, then local modules).

- External: `import { Button } from '@heroui/react'`
- Local: relative paths (`./`, `../`) within `frontend/src/`

## Secrets and configuration

Do not commit secrets, API keys, or credentials. Use environment variables or secure secret management. Never hardcode sensitive values in source.

## Rule and skill usage

Prefer scoped rules (globs) and Agent Skills for domain-specific guidance. Do not add new always-apply rules unless they are truly repo-wide non-negotiables.
